.temp/resources/TASK-260728-7ii1xz/TASK-260728-7ii1xz_reviewer-verdict-02.md-31-  message.” Its documented immediate error set includes
.temp/resources/TASK-260728-7ii1xz/TASK-260728-7ii1xz_reviewer-verdict-02.md-32-  `NEVPNErrorConfigurationInvalid` and
.temp/resources/TASK-260728-7ii1xz/TASK-260728-7ii1xz_reviewer-verdict-02.md:33:  `NEVPNErrorConfigurationDisabled`. The revised five-state revocation
