.temp/resources/TASK-260728-7ii1xz/TASK-260728-7ii1xz_macos-credential-transport-decision.md:242:| entitlement / portal cost | **highest.** For a sandboxed pair the Mach name must be prefixed by an entitled App Group or the targets need `com.apple.security.temporary-exception.mach-register.global-name` / `…mach-lookup.global-name`. `TASK-260715-ypo7yo` rule **X1** requires any exception entitlement to enter a reviewed-exception register. It also makes **OC-4** live: no Apple source confirms an iOS-style `group.` ID is accepted as a Mach service name prefix, and this project registered iOS-style groups on both platforms |
.temp/resources/TASK-260728-7ii1xz/TASK-260728-7ii1xz_macos-credential-transport-decision.md-243-| testability | worst — needs the installed, approved sysex before any round trip |
